Package: scfaReporter
Title: Standardized Short-Chain Fatty Acid Reporting Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Microbiome", "Insights", email = "info@microbiomeinsights.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Data Science Team", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: Utilities for loading Chromeleon SCFA chromatogram exports,
    joining them with sample manifests, normalizing concentrations, running
    ANOVA or mixed-effects models, and rendering a Quarto report template that
    mirrors Microbiome Insights’ standard SCFA deliverable.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
